            "note": "Graded high on the figures of the date: every figure is plain. Read here at magnification after the first reader gave 1904. The year's second figure is the rounded 9 of this hand, not the angular crossed 4 that opens the date; 1909 also restores the catalogue-number ordering, which 1904 broke."
           }
          ]
         }
        }
